[1554.087003, "o", "9.]+).*$\"\u001b[38;5;236m, \u001b[38;5;24m\"\\\\1\"\u001b[38;5;236m, prov\u001b[38;5;125m$\u001b[38;5;236mr_version),\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m9\u001b[15G\u001b[22mimputations \u001b[38;5;125m=\u001b[38;5;236m params()\u001b[38;5;125m$\u001b[38;5;236mimputation_m\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m數字代號都補好了。現在開始寫各段正文。\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=4fyq1c;file:///Users/Shared/her2-neoadjuvant-study/manuscript/text/abstract.md\u0007manuscript/text/abstract.md\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[1554.089341, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mual and single HER2 blockade in routine practice.                                                    \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m5\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m\u001b[48;5;224m  5 -\u001b[38;5;236m**Materials and Methods:** [TO BE WRITTEN BY AUTHORS]                                                \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236m**Materials and Methods:** This single-center retrospective cohort study emulated a target trial in p\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236matients with clinical stage II–III HER2-positive breast cancer who started neoadjuvant chemotherapy w\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mith trastuzumab between {{enroll_start}} and {{enroll_end}}. The primary outcome was pCR (ypT0/is ypN\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m0); isolated tumor cells in lymph nodes were not considered pCR. Because the two regimens were used i\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mn largely different years, the groups were balanced with propensity-score overlap weighting. Es"]
[1554.08948, "o", "timate\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236ms are reported with 95% confidence intervals (CIs).                                                  \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m7\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m\u001b[48;5;224m  7 -\u001b[38;5;236m**Results:** [TO BE WRITTEN BY AUTHORS]                                                              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m  8 +\u001b[38;5;236m**Results:** Of {{n_cohort}} patients, {{n_dual}} received trastuzumab plus pertuzumab and {{n_single\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m}} received trastuzumab alone. Unweighted pCR rates were {{pcr_crude_dual}} and {{pcr_crude_single}},\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m  \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;236mrespectively. After weighting, pCR rates were {{pcr_w_dual}} and {{pcr_w_single}}\u001b[94G(odds\u001b[100Gratio,\u001b[107G{{pcr\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m_or}}; {{pcr_p}}). With a median follow-up of {{median_fu}} years, the hazard ratios were {{efs_hr}} \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mfor event-free survival and {{os_hr}} for overall survival.                                 "]
[1554.089638, "o", "         \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m \u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m\u001b[48;5;224m  9 -\u001b[38;5;236m**Conclusion:** [TO BE WRITTEN BY AUTHORS]                                                           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 10 +\u001b[38;5;236m**Conclusion:** Dual HER2 blockade was associated with a higher pCR rate, consistent with randomized \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mtrials, but the estimate depended on adjustment for treatment era. The data were insufficient to asse\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mss event-free or overall survival.                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
