[1554.46205, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;160m\u001b[48;5;224m  5 -\u001b[38;5;236m**Materials and Methods:** [TO BE WRITTEN BY AUTHORS]                                                \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m  6 +\u001b[38;5;236m**Materials and Methods:** This single-center retrospective cohort study emulated a target trial in p\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236matients with clinical stage II–III HER2-positive breast cancer who started neoadjuvant chemotherapy w\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236mith \u001b[16Grastuzumab\u001b[27Gb\u001b[30Gween {{enroll_start}} and {{\u001b[59Gn\u001b[62Gll_end}}. T\u001b[74Ge primar\u001b[84Goutcom\u001b[91G w\u001b[94Gs pCR (ypT0/is ypN\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B0); isolated\u001b[24Gtumor cells in\u001b[39Glymph nodes were not\u001b[60Gconsidered pCR. Because the two regimens were used\u001b[111Gi\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bn largely differen\u001b[30G y\u001b[33Gars, the groups were balanced with propensity-score overlap weighting. Estimate\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bs are reported with 95% co\u001b[38Gfidence intervals\u001b[56G(CIs).        \u001b[71G    \u001b[76G       \u001b[84G   \u001b[88G   \u001b[92G        \u001b[101G    \u001b[106G    \u001b[111G \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b["]
