[1633.350261, "o", "trospective cohort of {{n_cohort}} patients with clinical stage II–III HER2-p\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mositive breast cancer, we compared neoadjuvant trastuzumab plus pertuzumab with trastuzumab alone, us\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236ming propensity-score overlap weighting to address the limited overlap between treatment eras. Dual HE\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mR2 blockade was associated with a higher pathologic complete response rate (odds ratio, {{pcr_or|b}})\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m, consistent with randomized trials, whereas the data were insufficient to assess event-free or overa\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mll survival. We believe that these real-world data, and the explicit handling of treatment-era confou\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mnding, will interest the readers of the Journal.                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m  9 +\u001b[38;5;2"]
[1633.350503, "o", "36m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 10 +\u001b[38;5;236mWe confirm that this manuscript has not been published, is not under consideration for publication el\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236msewhere, and has not been presented at a scientific meeting. The study received no funding. All autho\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mrs have read and approved the manuscript, meet the journal's criteria for authorship, and declare no \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mconflicts of interest. The study was approved by the institutional review board with a waiver of info\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mrmed consent, and the use of generative AI is disclosed in the manuscript.                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m 11 +\u001b[38;5;236m                                                                                                     \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 12 +\u001b[38;5;23"]
