[1743.956785, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G4. 請先關掉 Word，\u001b[38;5;105msubmission/\u001b[33G\u001b[39m裡的暫存檔就會消失，不要把它一起上傳。\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B這次檢查沒有修改任何檔案，所以不需要另外存檔。這支獨立檢查程式目前放在暫存區；如果您希望以後每次投稿前都跑一次，我可\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B以把它加進專案，成為 \u001b[38;5;105mmake submission\u001b[39m 的最後一步。\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 2m 2s · done 9:14 AM\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;241m❯ \u001b[38;5;16m幫我寫給編輯的 cover letter，然後存成「投稿版」。\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m先前的投稿包裡已經有一版 Cover letter\u001b[41G了。我依\u001b[50GJCRP\u001b[55G的要求把它補得更完整：\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G說明為什麼適合投這本期刊。\r\u001b[1B  - 列出隨附的文件，例如 STROBE 檢核表、補充資料、分析程式。\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G聲明沒有相關的其他稿件。\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r"]
[1743.956922, "o", "\u001b[2C\u001b[1B建議審稿人這一項是選填的，我不會填，因為那需要真實的人名，自己編造並不恰當。\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B改完後重新產生投稿包、再做一次獨立檢查，最後存成「投稿版」。\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=1bw8c78;file:///Users/Shared/her2-neoadjuvant-study/manuscript/text/cover_letter.md\u0007manuscript/text/cover_letter.md\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[1743.960131, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 11 +\u001b[38;5;236mDual HER2 blockade was associated with a higher pCR rate (odds ratio, {{pcr_or|b}}), consistent with \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mrandomized trials. We also report that the unweighted pCR rates were almost identical ({{pcr_crude_du\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mal}} and {{pcr_crude_single}}) and explain why, and we show that the data were insufficient to assess\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m event-free or overall survival. We believe that this transparent handling of treatment-era confoundi\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mng in a regional real-world cohort will interest the readers of the Journal, many of whom face the sa\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mme question when interpreting their own institutional data.                                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 12 \u001b[22m \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 13 +\u001b[38;5;236mWe confirm that this manuscript"]
[1743.960275, "o", " has not been published, is not under consideration for publication el\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236msewhere, and has not been presented at a scientific meeting, and that there are no related manuscript\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236ms. The study received no funding. All authors have read and approved the manuscript, meet the journal\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[5G \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m's criteria for authorship, and declare no conflicts of interest. The study was approved by the insti\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[5G \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mtutional review board with a waiver of informed consent. The analysis plan was finalized before outco\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[5G \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mmes were examined, and the use of generative AI is disclosed in the manuscript.                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m 14 +\u001b[38;5;236m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1"]
