[1753.726437, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mrandomized trials. We also report that the unweighted pCR rates were almost identical\u001b[48;5;157m,\u001b[48;5;194m \u001b[48;5;157mat \u001b[48;5;194m{{pcr_crude\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m_dual}} and {{pcr_crude_single}}\u001b[48;5;157m,\u001b[48;5;194m and explain why, and we show that the data were insufficient to ass\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mess event-free or overall survival. We believe that this transparent handling of treatment-era confou\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mnding in a regional real-world cohort will interest the readers of the Journal, many of whom face the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m same question when interpreting their own institutional data.                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 12 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 13 \u001b[22m We confirm that this manuscript has not been published, is not under consideration for publication el\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m sewhere, and has not been presented at a scientific meeting, and that"]
[1753.727616, "o", " there are no related manuscript\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m s. The study received no funding. All authors have read and approved the manuscript, meet the journal\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m 's criteria for authorship, and declare no conflicts of interest. The study was approved by the insti\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m tutional review board with a waiver of informed consent. The analysis plan was finalized before outco\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mmes were examined, and the use of generative AI is disclosed in the manuscript.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  … 5 more files changed\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  (timeout 10m)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m信件已改好，獨立檢查仍是 58/58 通過。\u001b[38;5;105mresults/\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B裡部分檔案只是因重跑分析而變更了時間戳記，內容無異，我會把它們還原成原版，僅提交 Cover letter\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B和重新產生的投稿檔並打上「投稿版」標記，避免版本紀錄出現無意義變動。\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1"]
