[1873.122286, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236mffer\u001b[17Gt years, groups\u001b[33Gw\u001b[35Gr\u001b[37G balanced with pro\u001b[56Gen\u001b[59Gity-score overlap w\u001b[79Gighting. Es\u001b[91Gimate\u001b[97G are repor\u001b[111Gw\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bith 95% confidence intervals (CIs).    \u001b[51G       \u001b[59G  \u001b[62G   \u001b[66G   \u001b[70G         \u001b[80G       \u001b[88G         \u001b[98G     \u001b[104G   \u001b[108G    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m\u001b[48;5;224m  8 -\u001b[38;5;236m**Results:** Of {{n_cohort}} patients, {{n_dual}} received trastuzumab plus pertuzumab and {{n_single\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236m}} received trastuzumab alone. Unweighted pCR rates were {{pcr_crude_dual}} and {{pcr_crude_single}},\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236m respectively. After weighting, pCR rates were {{pcr_w_dual}} and {{pcr_w_single}} (odds ratio, {{pcr\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236m_or|b}}; {{pcr_p}}). The association was attenuated only in a post hoc worst-case analysis assuming t\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236mhat all patients operated on elsewhere achieved pC"]
[1873.12243, "o", "R (odds ratio, {{or_elsewhere_all_pcr|b}}). With a \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;160m\u001b[48;5;224m    -\u001b[38;5;236mmedian follow-up of {{median_fu}} years, the hazard ratios were {{efs_hr}} for event-free survival an\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236md {{os_hr}} for overall survival.                                                                    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m  8 +\u001b[38;5;236m**Results:** Of {{n_cohort}} patients, {{n_dual}} received trastuzumab plus pertuzumab and {{n_single\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m}} received trastuzumab alone. Unweighted pCR rates were {{pcr_crude_dual}} and {{pcr_crude_single}}.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m After weighting, pCR rates were {{pcr_w_dual}} and {{pcr_w_single}} (odds ratio, {{pcr_or|b}}; {{pcr\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m_p}}). \u001b[48;5;157mIn\u001b[48;5;194m a post hoc worst-case analysis \u001b[48;5;157mof\u001b[48;5;194m patients operated on elsewhere\u001b[48;5;157m,\u001b[48;5;194m \u001b[48;5;157mthe\u001b[48"]
[1873.122589, "o", ";5;194m odds ratio \u001b[48;5;157mwas \u001b[48;5;194m{{or_e\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mlsewhere_all_pcr}}. With a median follow-up of {{median_fu}} years, the hazard ratios were {{efs_hr}}\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m for event-free survival and {{os_hr}} for overall survival.                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m **Conclusion:** Dual HER2 blockade was associated with a higher pCR rate, consistent with randomized \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m trials, but the estimate depended on adjustment for treatment era and on assumptions about patients w\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ithout pathology results. The data were insufficient to assess event-free or overall survival.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  \u001b[7Gtimeout 10m)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
