[1877.868539, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;160m\u001b[48;5;224m    -\u001b[38;5;236m_or|b}}; {{pcr_p}}). The association was attenuated only in a post hoc worst-case analysis assuming t\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236mhat all patients operated on elsewhere achieved pCR (odds ratio, {{or_elsewhere_all_pcr|b}}). With a \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236mmedian follow-up of {{median_fu}} years, the hazard ratios were {{efs_hr}} for event-free survival an\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236md {{os_hr}} for\u001b[27Goverall surviv\u001b[42Gl.     \u001b[50G          \u001b[61G        \u001b[70G           \u001b[82G    \u001b[87G          \u001b[98G   \u001b[102G          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m  8 +\u001b[38;5;236m**Results:** Of {{n_cohort}} patients, {{n_dual}} received trastuzumab plus pertuzumab and {{n_single\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m}} received trastuzumab alone. Unweighted pCR rates were {{pcr_crude_dual}} and {{pcr_crude_single}}.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m After weighting, pCR rates were {{pcr_w_dual}} and {{pcr_w_single}} (odds ratio, {{pcr_or|b}}; {{pcr\r\u001b[5"]
[1877.868672, "o", "C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m_p}}). \u001b[48;5;157mIn\u001b[48;5;194m a post hoc worst-case analysis \u001b[48;5;157mof\u001b[48;5;194m patients operated on elsewhere\u001b[48;5;157m,\u001b[48;5;194m \u001b[48;5;157mthe\u001b[48;5;194m odds ratio \u001b[48;5;157mwas \u001b[48;5;194m{{or_e\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mlsewhere_all_pcr}}. With a median follow-up of {{median_fu}} years, the hazard ratios were {{efs_hr}}\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m for event-free survival and {{os_hr}} for overall survival.                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m **Conclusion:** Dual HER2 blockade was associated with a higher pCR rate, consistent with randomized \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m trials, but the estimate depended on adjustment for treatment era and on assumptions about patients w\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ithout pathology results. The data were insufficient to assess event-free or overall survival.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  (timeout 10m)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m摘要"]
[1877.868837, "o", "已改成\u001b[14G242\u001b[18G字，檢查全數通過。我同時發現並修正了原稿中將\u001b[63GE-value\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B誤寫成勝算比（應為風險比）的用詞錯誤，並補上方法段漏寫的「追蹤時間中位數採反向 Kaplan-Meier\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B法估計」說明（恰好回應了審稿人 R2.2 的提問）。接下來撰寫回覆信，僅記錄回應內容與修改位置，不重複抄錄審稿原文。\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m⏺\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;174m·\u001b[3GFrosting\u001b[38;5;216m…\u001b[38;5;174m \u001b[25G\u001b[38;5;241m4\u001b[27G1\u001b[39G\u001b[38;5;248mthinking with high effort\u001b[38;5;241m)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
