[1880.577728, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m for event-free survival and {{os_hr}} for overall survival.                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m **Conclusion:** Dual HER2 blockade was associated with a higher pCR rate, consistent with randomized \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m trials, but the estimate depended on adjustment for treatment era and on assumptions about patients w\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ithout pathology results. The data were insufficient to assess event-free or overall survival.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  (timeout 10m)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m摘要已改成 242 字，檢查全數通過。我同時發現並修正了原稿中將 E-value\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B誤寫成勝算比（應為風險比）的用詞錯誤，並補上方法段漏寫的「追蹤時間中位數採反向 Kaplan-Meier\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B法估計」說明（恰好回應了審稿人 R2.2 的提問）。接下來撰寫回覆信，僅記錄回應內容與修"]
[1880.577852, "o", "改位置，不重複抄錄審稿原文。\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mFixing E-value wording, adding reverse KM, writing response source\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  $ python3 - <<'EOF'\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mimport pathlib\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;241mdef \u001b[11Gdi\u001b[14G(path, pairs):\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bp = pathlib.Path(path); s = p.read_text()\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;241mfor a, b in pairs:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;241massert s.count(a) == 1, (path, a[:60]); s = s.replace(a, b)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;241mp.write_text(s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241medit(\"manuscript/text/discussion.md\", [\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;241m(\"an unmeasured confounder associated with both treatment and pC…\r\u001b[17C\u001b[2B9\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[1880.579907, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[11B\u001b[38;5;241m⏺\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[1880.60875, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[48;5;194mwith Schoenf\u001b[25Gld res\u001b[32Gduals\u001b[48;5;157m, and median follow-up was estimated with the reverse Kaplan-Meier method\u001b[48;5;194m.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mPrespecified sensitivity analyses restricted the cohort to patients who started treatment in 2016–201\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m9, used one-to-one propensity-score matching, used multivariable regression, defined pCR as ypT0 ypN0\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m, and included only patients with complete covariate data. An exploratory analysis tested whether the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m association with pCR differed by hormone receptor status. The E-value was calculated to quantify how\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m strong unmeasured confounding would need to be to explain away the primary result.[@vanderweele2017e\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mvalue] Two-sided *P* values below 0.05 were considered statistically significant. Analyses were perfo\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3"]
[1880.608892, "o", "G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mrmed with R version {{r_version}} using the WeightIt, MatchIt, cobalt, mice, survival, and EValue pac\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mkages.                                                                                               \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 23 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 24 \u001b[22m In response to peer review, we performed the following post hoc analyses, which were not part of the \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m prespecified plan: the distribution of propensity scores by group and the share of the overlap weight\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m s contributed by each treatment period; a propensity-score model with a natural spline for year of tr\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m eatment start; EFS restricted to patients who started treatment in 2012–2019, before adjuvant T-DM1 w\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m as used at the study hospital, instead of stratification by post-neoadjuvant T-DM1, which would co"]
[1880.609048, "o", "ndi\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m tion on a consequence of the response to neoadjuvant therapy; pCR after exclusion of patients whose d\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m isease progressed before surgery; best-case and worst-case analyses that included the patients operat\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ed on at another hospital, assigned to groups by pertuzumab use within 180 days of the index date and\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m  assumed either all to achieve or all not to achieve pCR; and EFS and OS with follow-up truncated at \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m five years, together with the five-year restricted mean survival time (RMST) difference.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 25 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;174m·\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;216mFrosting…\u001b[26G\u001b[38;5;241m7\u001b[28G7\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
