[1886.509536, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;160m\u001b[48;5;224m    -\u001b[38;5;236m and {{efs_5y_single}}, respectively (HR, {{efs_hr|b}}; {{efs_p}}) (Table 3, Figure 2). Deaths occurr\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236med in {{os_events_dual}} and {{os_events_single}} patients, and the weighted five-year OS rates were \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236m{{os_5y_dual}} and {{os_5y_single}} (HR, {{os_hr|b}}; {{os_p}}) (Figure 3). The five-year RMST differ\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236mence was {{rmst5_efs}} for EFS and {{rmst5_os}} for OS. The confidence interval for OS was wide and c\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236mompatible with both a clinically important benefit and harm. There was no evidence against proportion\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236mal hazards for EFS ({{efs_ph_p}}) or OS ({{os_ph_p}}). Among patients who did not achieve pCR, adjuva\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236mnt T-DM1 was given to {{tdm1_non_pcr_dual}} in the dual-blockade group and {{tdm1_non_pcr_single}} in\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;160m    -\u001b[38;5;236m the single-bl"]
[1886.509676, "o", "ockade group.                                                                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 15 +\u001b[38;5;236mEFS events occurred in {{efs_events_dual}} patients who received dual blockade and in {{efs_events_si\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mngle}} patients who received trastuzumab alone. The weighted five-year EFS rates were {{efs_5y_dual}}\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m and {{efs_5y_single}}, respectively (HR, {{efs_hr|b}}) (Table 3, Figure 2). Deaths occurred in {{os_\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mevents_dual}} and {{os_events_single}} patients, and the weighted five-year OS rates were {{os_5y_dua\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236ml}} and {{os_5y_single}} (HR, {{os_hr|b}}) (Figure 3). The five-year RMST difference was {{rmst5_efs}\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m} for EFS and {{rmst5_os}} for OS. The confidence interval for OS was wide and compatible with both a\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49"]
[1886.509836, "o", "m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m clinically important benefit and harm. There was no evidence against proportional hazards for EFS ({\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m{efs_ph_p}}) or OS ({{os_ph_p}}). Among patients who did not achieve pCR, adjuvant T-DM1 was given to\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m {{tdm1_non_pcr_dual}} in the dual-blockade group and {{tdm1_non_pcr_single}} in the single-blockade \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mgroup.                                                                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 16 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 17 \u001b[22m ## Sensitivity and Subgroup Analyses\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 18 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;174mFrosting…\u001b[26G\u001b[38;5;241m2\u001b[28G4\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
