[1887.927232, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[22B\u001b[38;5;174m✶\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[1887.939394, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[48;5;224mal hazard\u001b[21G for EFS ({{efs_ph_p}}) or\u001b[48GOS ({\u001b[54Gos_ph_p}}). Among patients who\u001b[85Gdid not achieve pCR,\u001b[106Gadj\u001b[110Gva\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bnt\u001b[14GT-DM1 was given to {{tdm1_non_pcr_dual}} in the dual-blocka\u001b[74Ge group and {{tdm1_non_pcr_single}} in\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B the single-blockade group.        \u001b[47G    \u001b[52G            \u001b[65G         \u001b[75G       \u001b[83G   \u001b[87G   \u001b[91G         \u001b[101G    \u001b[106G      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 15 +\u001b[38;5;236mEFS events occurred in {{efs_events_dual}} patients who received dual blockade and in {{efs_events_si\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mngle}} patients who received trastuzumab alone. The weighted five-year EFS rates were {{efs_5y_dual}}\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m and {{efs_5y_single}}, respectively (HR, {{efs_hr|b}}) (Table 3, Figure 2). Deaths occurred in {{os_\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mevents_dual}} and {{os_events_single}} patients, and the weighted five-year OS rates were {{os_5y_dua\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236ml}}"]
[1887.939541, "o", " and {{os_5y_single}} (HR, {{os_hr|b}}) (Figure 3). The five-year RMST difference was {{rmst5_efs}\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236m} for EFS and {{\u001b[28Gmst5_os}} for OS. The confidence interval for OS w\u001b[79Gs\u001b[81Gwide \u001b[87Gnd\u001b[90Gcompatibl\u001b[100G with both a\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B c\u001b[14Ginically important b\u001b[35Gnefit and har\u001b[49G. There was no \u001b[65Gvidence against propo\u001b[87Gtional hazards for EFS ({\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B{efs_ph_p}}) or OS ({{os_ph_p}}). Among pati\u001b[56Gnts who did not achieve pCR, adjuv\u001b[91Gnt T-DM1 was\u001b[104Ggiven to\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B {{tdm1_non_pcr_\u001b[28Gual}} in the dual-block\u001b[52Gde group and {{tdm1_non_pcr_single}} in \u001b[93Ghe\u001b[96Gsingle-blocka\u001b[110Ge \r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bgroup. \u001b[19G                \u001b[36G    \u001b[41G            \u001b[54G       \u001b[62G   \u001b[66G   \u001b[70G         \u001b[80G    \u001b[85G          \u001b[96G   \u001b[100G            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 16 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 17 \u001b[22m ## Sensitivity and Subgroup Analyses\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 18 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m比對程式測出兩個"]
[1887.939708, "o", "瑕疵：引用標記黏在前一個字上造成誤判，以及兩版引用編號不一致導致同篇文獻被誤認為不同引用。我會讓引用\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B標記獨立成詞並改用文獻名稱當代號來修正。\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand…\r\u001b[25C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;241m3\u001b[28G1\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
